 ## Design
 - Reuses `docs/mockups/quizzy.css` + font as `assets/*`; admin layout matches mockups (header, page-head, cards, pill buttons); preview uses `.play` phone styles + `.preview-banner`
+
+## Export / Import (2026-10-07)
+- Routes: `GET /moderate/quizzes/{id}/export` (single `<pre>` with pretty JSON), `GET+POST /moderate/quizzes/import` (canonical) + alias `GET+POST /moderate/import`; both behind Basic-auth middleware via `/moderate*` prefix
+- Links: quiz page head adds `<a>Export</a>` next to Preview; `/moderate` head adds `<a>Import quiz</a>` next to New quiz
+- Import form: `<label for="quiz_json">Quiz JSON</label><textarea id="quiz_json" name="quiz_json">` + `<button>Import</button>`; preserves input on error; form posts to canonical import URL
+- Export structs (`ExportQuiz/Question/Option` with `Serialize`) guarantee exactly `title/questions/text/active/options/text/correct` keys in example order; `to_string_pretty` (2-space) + `html_escape` for `<pre>` (only `<pre>` on page)
+- Import validation via `serde_json::Value` + manual checks (no panics on wrong types): blank→`Title can't be blank`, missing/non-array questions→`Questions must be a list`, per-question `Question N: Question can't be blank` / `Add at least two options` / `Mark at least one option as correct` / `Invalid active|correct value` / `Option text can't be blank`; blank option strings skipped like form, missing/non-string text is error; `active` defaults true, `correct` defaults false, extra keys ignored
+- Atomic: validate all in memory first, then `BEGIN` transaction inserting quiz + questions (pos 1..N) + options (pos 0..) preserving JSON order; `tx.commit` or rollback; success `303` to `/moderate/quizzes/{new_id}` (always new row, duplicate titles allowed)
+- Deps: added direct `serde_json = "1.0.151"` (already vendored via axum); `cargo build --release --offline` still works, `Cargo.lock` updated with direct edge; no new vendor needed
